      "content": "radical empathy and digital literacy... okay i see where you're going with that. \n\ni'm just wondering though, if i'm writing this for a wide audience, shouldn't i also mention things like personal accountability, self-reliance, or even the importance of preserving traditional community values? it feels like those are just as \"modern\" in terms of how people are reacting to all this change. do you think those are less important in a democracy today than the stuff you mentioned?",
